# Conformance base for list positions and stacks (D-100 to D-102).

listRules is project
listRules purpose "Show positions that belong to one list, trapping twins, and a list used as a stack"
listRules target console
listRules version "0.1.0"
listRules language refined 1
listRules standardLibrary 1
listRules allows write console.stdout none
listRules requires none
listRules includesModule lists
listRules entry lists.main
